  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh RRNRP : Support to Save the Children for humanitarian aid during emergencies and other national disasters.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is bilateral ODA and fully concessional. This is ODA eligible as the programme will be providing humanitarian aid / disaster relief to vulnerable Bangladeshi communities who are affected by climate induced disasters in the country. Bangladesh is within the DAC List of ODA recipient countries. The support is provided through Save the Children which is within the DAC list of ODA eligible organization.</narrative>
  </description>
